  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Satelite Data Management System (SEPAL) phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved monitoring of forests and forest based greenhouse gas emissions through building and operating cloud based platform which can process large amounts of remote sensing data - phase II of project. The satellite data program is also used for adaptation purposes, e.g. monitoring and assessment of risks in the case of endings in vegetation and water bodies.</narrative>
  </description>
